	(text "5 V (U4, TPS61023 boost from 3.3 V): VOUT = 0.595 V x (1 + R27/R28) = 5.06 V for the lidar and the RGB LED.\nC28 adds a 1 kHz feed-forward zero (C = 1 / (2 pi x 1 kHz x R27) = 10 nF)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "03303a94-ed3f-4d7a-a081-349bbe9536d8")
	)
	(text "Logic supply: D6/D7 (SS34) pick the higher of VSYS (battery) and VBUS (USB), so USB powers only the logic\n(never motors or servos) and never charges the cells. U3 (TPS62130A, 3-17 V in, 3 A) makes 3.3 V and runs\nat 100 % duty when the battery is low. VOUT = 0.8 V x (1 + R24/R25) = 3.31 V; 2.5 MHz (FSW low), 1 uH + 2x 22 uF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6ea6ac0c-9f74-431a-8a7e-e22d195b5ee3")
	)
	(text "Servo eFuse (U10, TPS259571): 2.0 A limit (2000 / R42 + 0.04 A),\nauto-retry after a fault, switches on above 3.6 V and off below 3.3 V (R40 200k / R41 100k, battery empty).\nServos get the battery voltage: 4.0-6.4 V (use 6 V servos).\nD8 (SS34) clamps negative spikes from the servo motors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 185.42 27.94 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a7edc86e-0ad9-43aa-af37-73684f29eae1")
	)
	(text "+3V3_EXT: Ilim = 6800 / R29 = 0.57 A (sensors, encoders)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c8dbddef-8055-430f-94cd-22723aa33f90")
	)
	(text "+5V_EXT: Ilim = 6800 / R30 = 0.68 A (lidar / UART header)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 156.21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d7d2f176-a2a6-41c9-9a46-120ebd0b3f63")
	)
